# M5. The stop switch latches stop_circuit_opened when idle and when moving. Releasing it resumes nothing,
# torque is read afresh, and the fault can't be cleared while the stop is still pressed.
expect motion mode ready
# Idle.
key stop-switch
expect motion fault stop_circuit_opened system
expect motion mode fault
key stop-switch
expect motion stop-sense released
expect motion torque left follower off (re-read)
key operator-clear
expect motion target fault.clear operator_cli
expect spoke Clear the arm faults. Press Confirm to go ahead.
wait 2100
key c
expect motion cleared all faults
expect motion mode ready
# Moving.
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key offer-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose started offer
wait 200
key stop-switch
expect motion fault stop_circuit_opened system
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose faulted offer
# On the servos: within 5° of where it stopped (its power is cut), and no goal written after.
wait 200
key inspect-hold-left
expect sim left follower hold ok
absent 1000 sim goal-write left follower
# Still pressed: clearing is refused at once, before anyone is asked to press Confirm.
key operator-clear
expect motion command fault.clear refused:cause_present operator_cli
key stop-switch
expect motion stop-sense released
key operator-clear
wait 2100
key c
expect motion cleared all faults
key q
